<title>USA: Santa Barbara offers to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Santa Barbara offers to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Barbara Bancorp, the holding company for Santa Barbara Bank &amp; Trust, has announced an offer to buy for cash up to 500,000 shares of its common stock at $30.00 net per share.</p>
<p>The offer will begin January 10, 1997, and will expire Friday, February 21, 1997.</p>
</text>
